  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $Z,=\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi r}{11}-i \\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{11}$\r\n$$\r\n=-i\\left(\\cos \\frac{2 \\pi r}{11}+i \\sin \\frac{2 \\pi r}{11}\\right)\r\n$$\r\n$\\therefore$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&=-i e^{\\frac{i 2 \\pi}{11}} \\\\\r\n\\sum_{r=0}^{10} Z_{r} &=-i \\sum_{r=0}^{10} e^{\\frac{i 2 \\pi}{11}}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\n=-i \\times 0=0\r\n$$",
